\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\tab COME, and let us sweetly join
\par \pard\li720 Christ to praise in hymns divine ;
\par Give we all, with one accord,
\par Glory to our common Lord.
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.\tab Hands and hearts and voices raise ;
\par \pard\li720 Sing as in the ancient days ;
\par Antedate the joys above,
\par Celebrate the feast of love.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.\tab Strive we, in affection strive ;
\par \pard\li720 Let the purer flame revive,
\par Such as in the martyrs glowed,
\par Dying champions for their God.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.\tab We, like them, may live and love ;
\par \pard\li720 Called we are their joys to prove,
\par Saved with them from future wrath,
\par Partners of like precious faith.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.\tab Sing we them in Jesu's name,
\par \pard\li720 Now as yesterday the same ;
\par One in every time and place,
\par Full for all of truth and grace.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.\tab We for Christ, our Master, stand,
\par \pard\li720 Lights in a benighted land :
\par We our dying Lord confess ;
\par We are Jesu's witnesses.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7.\tab Christ is now gone up on high,
\par \pard\li720 Thither all our wishes fly ;
\par Sits at God's right hand above,
\par There with Him we reign in love.
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b 
\par \'b6    Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par      8.Christ is now gone up on high
\par      Tither all our wishes fly;
\par      Sit's at God's right hand above,
\par      There with Him we reign in love.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

